cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "model_cultural_comp: mapping LLM cultural alignment onto the Inglehart-Welzel map"
abstract: >-
  Fits a custom two-dimensional instrument inspired by the Inglehart-Welzel
  map using Gaussian probabilistic PCA over ten Integrated Values Surveys items,
  then administers the same ten
  items to large language models and projects their responses through the same
  frozen transform the countries go through. Each model-language cell gets a
  nominal bootstrap ellipse, two region-assignment rules, and classifier-free
  headline statistics.
